<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1PE" style="id">- Kwamashi 2022</book>
  <para style="h">1 PETURU</para>
  <para style="toc1">Diñoro dya Peturu dyo Kutanga</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Peturu</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Pet</para>
  <para style="mt2">Diñoro dyo Kutanga dya</para>
  <para style="mt1">Peturu</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1PE 1" />
  <para style="rem">TA, MN, TC, CC, TA, Trt</para>
  <para style="s1">Kuvumenena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 1:1" />Yame no Peturu, kanganda ka Yesu Krisitu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:1">Naa ñorera anua Nyambi o ku hanguriwa awa na panthzaana no ku kekara enda mu Pontasi, Galatia, Kapadosia, Asia no mu Bitinia. <verse eid="1PE 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 1:2" />Nyambi Tata wa mi dimukire kare no ku mi hangura, Mupepo wenthzi na u mi tende owakenu ci nga mu yuvere Yesu Krisitu no ku yoiwa konyinga wenthzi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Diya 24.1-11, “ku shamawera onyinga.”</char></note> Nyambi a mi pe kongi thsihemo no thsiyaro.<verse eid="1PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okurupero o mwoyo o diyere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 1:3" />Ku shangariwe Nyambi, Tata wa Fumu wetu Yesu Krisitu! Ko ñeke thzenthzi thzothzikuru na twerekiwa ope, inene Nyambi wa pindurire Yesu Krisitu kwafu. Pano honi twaa yoya kokurupero oukuru, <verse eid="1PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 1:4" />karo mu di nepiwa i shoro, nji kwipa nji ku vunduka, eyi i na turekiwera amwe mu wiru. <verse eid="1PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 1:5" />Ko thsitawo thsenu, Nyambi aa mi nyunga kokoro wenthzi shime ku ka kuma apa mwa ku tambwera kuyoyithsiwa oku ku na tatereriwa ku hokoriwa mu diyuwa dyo mahurerero.<verse eid="1PE 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 1:6" />Mweyi yoihe mu nyanyuke, shaanga ikare ci mwaa roera ku nyandithsiwa mu thsikati thsothsipu mukaci ko makando o kucithsiathsia. <verse eid="1PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 1:7" />Eyo iereka kenge ya ku monithsa ci thsitawo thsenu thsa shemwa, athso thsothsikuru mu thsivaka kupita gauda oyu nepanga shaanga ci aa erekiwanga mu mudiro. Thsitawo thsenu yoihe thsi tanara, kenge mwa ku shangariwa, no ku piwa kutethzima no direma mu diyuwa edi a ku hokoriwa Yesu Krisitu. <verse eid="1PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 1:8" />Mwakwa ku mu shima shaanga ci ka mwa mu mona. Karo shaanga ci kadi mwakwa ku mu mona thsino thsikati, mwaa tawa ku kwenthzi no ku nyanyuka ko thsinyanyu thso kutethzima no kukana ku twethsa ku tongononiwa. <verse eid="1PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 1:9" />Muyambo o thsitawo thsenu po kenge wa kwikara kuyoyithsiwa ko myoyo thzenu.<verse eid="1PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 1:10" />Oku kuyoyithsiwa, kodiyo a fotithsithsire nawa akwakukethza ci a ku dimukere ou okethzire yothsi thsihemo ethsi thsa roithsiwerire amwe. <verse eid="1PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 1:11" />A erekire ku fotithsithsa thsikati nedi nga ya ku tendahara eyi wa wa monithsire Mupepo wa Krisitu ou wekarire kukwo, ou okethzire yo makando a Krisitu no kutethzima oku nga kwa kukeya munyima thzao. <verse eid="1PE 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 1:12" />Ya hokoriwire kukwo ci ka cikwamenine athsinda unone amwe, ou a ambire eyi a wa pire Nyambi ku amba enu eyi na mu tongweriwa kowa na hongo Muthzimbu Ouwa ku kwenu kokoro o Mupepo Oukenu ku tunda ku wiru. Mane shaanga tungeru nato twaa cikumbwethza ku fotithsithsa eyi enu.<verse eid="1PE 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwikare owakenu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 1:13" />Mweyo, mu roithsere maano enu ku kwama, karo mu cihenge. Mu pake okurupero wenu ko kuyara pa thsihemo ethsi mwa ku piwa Yesu Krisitu ou a ku hokoriwa pa kukeya kwenthzi. <verse eid="1PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 1:14" />Ko kwikara ana Nyambi awa a mu yuvera, mwa hukera karo mwoyo o kare wecikumbwethza yoimango ou mwekarire nao o ku mu shime ku dimuka Nyambi. <verse eid="1PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 1:15" />Unone eci edi a di omukenu oyu na a mithsi, namwe mwikare owakenu mwinu yoihe eyi mu kwama. <verse eid="1PE 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 1:16" />Inene ku na ñoriwa ci: “Mwikare owakenu, inene ame no mukenu.”<verse eid="1PE 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 1:17" />Pakuninga ci yoihe mu rombera kwa Nyambi mwaa ethsanga ci Tata, aye oyu na raturanga etenda yo munu no munu ko kupira mavwevwe, mu yoye ko kuyapa Nyambi uno mu yoya eci matundakure muno mu kaye. <verse eid="1PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 1:18" />Inene mu na dimuka ci nedi kadi kenu yo kwora yo kucipitura eci silivera no gauda eyi mwa paturithsiwire ku mwoyo u shikwathsa thsimweya, ou mwa wanine ku tunderera kwakwathsañuruenu. <verse eid="1PE 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 1:19" />Unone shime mwa paturiwire konyinga oukuru mu thsivaka wa Krisitu, aye Dinguana dya Nyambi o kupira kapongonyi nji katamwethzi. <verse eid="1PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 1:20" />Nyambi wa mu hangurire kukare kaye o kuka shime kumbiwa, pano honi na a mu hokora muno mu mayuwa o mahurerero mukaci kenu.<verse eid="1PE 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 1:21" />Kenthzi aye Krisitu na mu tawa kwa Nyambi, aye oyu wa mu pindurire kwafu no ku mu pa kutethzima. Mweyo, thsitawo thsenu nokurupero wenu kwa Nyambi i di.<verse eid="1PE 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 1:22" />Pakuninga honi ci na mu cikenithsa ku thsivi ko ku yuvera oshemwa ci nga mu cishime shemwa eci ana o dira dyofoci, mu cishime nene ko micima thzenu thzothzihe.<verse eid="1PE 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 1:23" />Inene na mwerekiwa ope, kadi ko mbuto thzo ku twethsa kwora, unone thzi shoro, ko diywi dya Nyambi edi di yoya, karo dyo kukana ku pwa. <verse eid="1PE 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 1:24" />Eci edi ku na ñoriwa ci,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">“Anu wahe aa cipitura eci muhonyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 1:24">karo kutethzima kwo kwaa cipitura eci matemo o mu murundu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">Muhonyi yoihe u kukuta no matemo aa kurumukako,<verse eid="1PE 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 1:25" />unone diywi dya Fumu po dya diyere.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:25">Karo edyo diywi po Muthzimbu Ouwa uya wa hongiwire ku kwenu.<verse eid="1PE 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1PE 2" />
  <para style="rem">MN, MN, TC, CC, Trt</para>
  <para style="s1">Diwe edi di yoya no mbunga thzothzikenu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 2:1" />Mweyo, mu thsie omango ouhe, no kwangera kokuhe, no mahetaheta, no mbamba no kwipithsa amweya mathzina kokuhe. <verse eid="1PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 2:2" />Mu cipiture eci tumbu, mu fote nene mahwe oakenu o Mupepo, ci nga a mi kurithse mu kuyoyithsiwa kwenu, <verse eid="1PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 2:3" />pakuninga honi ci na mu ereka owa o thsihemo thsa Fumu.<verse eid="1PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 2:4" />Mu keye ku kwenthzi, aye diwe edi di yoya, edi a kanine anu unone na di hanguriwa kwa Nyambi no kwikara dyodikuru mu thsivaka ku kwenthzi.<verse eid="1PE 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 2:5" />Namwe mu nekara eci mawe aa a yoya, aa a umbiwa nthzio thzo mupepo, kwikara opurisita oukenu, ku tupura eyambero yo mupepo yo ku tamburiwa kwa Nyambi ka Yesu Krisitu. <verse eid="1PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 2:6" />Inene mu Mañoro ku na ñoriwa ci,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">“Naa paka diwe mu Sione,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">diwe dyo diunthzi dyo mu mbango, edi di na hanguriwa karo dikuru mu thsivaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">yomuhe o ku mu kurupera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">ka a ku fithsiwa honyi.”<verse eid="1PE 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 2:7" />Uno honi ku kwenu amwe mu na tawa, edi diwe po dikuru mu thsivaka. Unone kowa a na kana ku tawa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:7">“Diwe edi na kana akwakuumba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:7">di na piruka diunthzi dyo mu mbango.”<verse eid="1PE 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 2:8" />Karo ku na ñoriwa ci,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:8">“Edi po diwe edi di kuñukithsa anu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:8">karo edi di wa retera ci a we.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 2:8">Aa kuñuka inene ka yuverire diywi. Eyo modiyo a i shimenine Nyambi kukwo.<verse eid="1PE 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 2:9" />Uno honi amwe po mwanu o ku hanguriwa, opurisita o thsifumu, mbunga thzothzikenu, anua Nyambi. Mwaa hangweriwa ku raura ekwama yoiwa nene yoyu na a mithsi ku tunda mu mirema kwingena mu mwethzi wenthzi o ku komokithsa. <verse eid="1PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 2:10" />Pa kutanga ka mwekarire anua Nyambi, uno honi pano mwanua Nyambi. Pa kutanga ka mwa tamburire ñeke, uno honi pano na mu tambura ñeke.<verse eid="1PE 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 2:11" />Ashimiwa ange, naa adikana ku mi romba ci eci edi mu di ci mwenda, karo mwa matundakure muno mu kaye, mu tunde kwicikumbwethza yerama, eyi i rwithsa myoyo thzenu. <verse eid="1PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 2:12" />Mu yoye nawa mu kaci ko mahedeni, ci shaanga wowa mi capa eamba, nga a mone etenda yenu yoiwa no ku shangara Nyambi mu Diyuwa edi a ku keya.<verse eid="1PE 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuyuvera oendithsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 2:13" />Mukaci ka Fumu, mu cihuthse kushi thzanu wahe awa na piwa oendithsi, ikare aye fumu muendithsi shokuru, <verse eid="1PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 2:14" />nji ku manguvuru awa naa tumu ku pa humbithso awa a tenda yoimango no ku shangara awa a tenda yoiwa.<verse eid="1PE 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 2:15" />Inene eshima ya Nyambi po ci nga mu kwame yoiwa ci mu tutwarithse kupira odimukero kwanu wetomba. <verse eid="1PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 2:16" />Mu yoye eci anu o kurukuruka, unone mwa cikwathsithsa kurukuruka kwenu ku thsika omango, mu yoye eci apika Nyambi. <verse eid="1PE 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 2:17" />Mu remeke munu yomuhe, mu shime akwakutawa amweya. Mu yape Nyambi, karo mu remeke fumu.<verse eid="1PE 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muro o makando a Krisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 2:18" />Apika, mu cihuthse kushi thzañathsirenu, mu wa monithse direma dyodihe, kadi kowa owawa nowa o kuwamicima pohuma, unone nowa o ñore. <verse eid="1PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 2:19" />Inene mwaa roerithsa Nyambi yoihe mu kwama eyi mu na dimuka ci yaa roera, no ku cithzua mathsiwa o makando ko kupira ethsi na mwipithsa. <verse eid="1PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 2:20" />Thsine mwa ku wanapo yoihe mu cithzua pa ku mi furera eyi mu nepithsa? Uno honi ngeci mwaa cithzua mu makando, pa ku nyandithsiwera enu yoiwa eyi na mu kwama, apo honi po enu yoiwa pa meho a Nyambi.<verse eid="1PE 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 2:21" />Eyi yodiyo a mithserire Nyambi, inene Krisitu wa mi nyanderire, ku mi thsiera muro ci mu ende omu a endire. <verse eid="1PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 2:22" />“Ka a tendire thsivi, karo kwangera ka kwa waniwire mu kanwa kenthzi.” <verse eid="1PE 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 2:23" />Ou a tukathzaniwire ka a wa pirukire ku wa tuka, ou a nyandithsiwire ka a wa kanyine, unone wa pakire enu yoihe mu moko oyu na raturanga komu ku na roera. <verse eid="1PE 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 2:24" />Aye thsinda wa shimbire evi yetu mwirama yenthzi pa mbinda, ci nga tu fe ku thsivi no ku yoya kowawa. Ketwa yenthzi na mu porithsiwa. <verse eid="1PE 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 2:25" />Inene amwe shime mwekarire eci mangu o ku yonga, uno honi pano na mu huka kwa Mudithsani no Mutangereri o myoyo thzenu.<verse eid="1PE 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1PE 3" />
  <para style="rem">MN, MN, TC, CC, Trt</para>
  <para style="s1">Anu nanuwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 3:1" />Mofoci, namwe mwambuyama mu cihuthse kushi thzanuwenu, ci ngeci amweya kukwo kadi akwa ku yuvera diywi dya Nyambi, a twethse ku retiwa mu thsitawo ko mikarero thzothziwa thzanuwo ko kukana ku amba diywi. <verse eid="1PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 3:2" />Kenge a ku cimonena kukena kwenu no mikarero thzenu thzo direma.<verse eid="1PE 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 3:3" />Owa wenu wa tunderera kwiciyenga yo peuru, yo kupitura eci mirukero thzo kucithsiathsia thzo huki, nji epako yo gauda, nji evata yoiwa. <verse eid="1PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 3:4" />Unone owa wenu wikare o mu kaci, ao owa u shipu, o kuwamucima, o mupepo o ku tutwara, ao oukuru mu thsivaka pa meho a Nyambi. <verse eid="1PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 3:5" />Inene kenge dya ciyengangire ambuyama owakenu o kukare awa a kuruperire Nyambi. Shime a cihuthsangire kushi thzanuwo, <verse eid="1PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 3:6" />eci Sara, aye oyu wa yuverire Aburahama no ku mwithsa ci fumu wenthzi. Mwana Sara o wambuyama ngeci amwepo mu kwama eyi i na roera ko kukana ku yapa thsimweya.<verse eid="1PE 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 3:7" />Mofoci namwe mwakwerume, mu yoye nawa nanuwenu ko ku dimuka ci akwa ku faratera kupita amwe. Mu wa remeke, inene kenge mwa ku tambwera mofoci thsipa thsa Nyambi thso thsihemo thso mwoyo oupe. Mu tende kengeyo ci kwekara thsinu thsimweya ethsi nga thsi kwangithsa erombero yenu.<verse eid="1PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kunyandera ku kwama yoiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 3:8" />Ko ku manenena, mwaheno mwikare no mucima ofoci no kwikara no ñekeñeke. Mu cishime oandu namweya eci ana o dira dyofoci, karo mwikare no ñekeñeke no ku cihuthsa kushi. <verse eid="1PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 3:9" />Mwa huthsera omango nomango nji matuka no matuka. Uno honi mu huthsere omango ko thsiyauthzi, inene eyi yodiyo na a mithsera Nyambi, ci mu wane thsiyauthzi. <verse eid="1PE 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 3:10" />Inene ku na ñoriwa ci,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">“Yomuhe o ku fota ku cikora mwoyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">no ku fota ku mona mayuwa oawa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">a nyunge rudimi rwenthzi kwinu yoimango,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">karo a nyunge miromo thzenthzi ku ku amba yo kwangera.<verse eid="1PE 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 3:11" />A tunde kumango a kwame yoiwa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:11">A fotafote thsiyaro ko mucima wenthzi ouhe.<verse eid="1PE 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 3:12" />Inene meho a Fumu aa tanekera kowa owawawa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">karo matwi enthzi aa teerera erombero yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:12">unone Fumu aa pa muongo awa a tenda yoimango.”<verse eid="1PE 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 3:13" />Edye oyu nga mi yuvithsa kukora ngeci mwaa shima nene ku tenda yoiwa? <verse eid="1PE 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 3:14" />Uno honi shaanga yamwe mu nyandera yoiwa, kenge mwa kwikara no thsiyauthzi. Mwa yapa munu nji ku cithzekera thsimweya. <verse eid="1PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 3:15" />Uno honi mwikare no direma kwa Krisitu Fumu mu micima thzenu. Mu ciroithsere thsikati thsothsihe ku tawa awa a mipura mukaci kokurupero ou mu di nao. <verse eid="1PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 3:16" />Uno honi mu i kwame ko kuwamucima no direma. Mwikare no mumoneno ouwa, ci awa a mipithsa mathzina mukaci ko mikarero thzenu thzothziwa mwa Krisitu nga a ene. <verse eid="1PE 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 3:17" />Inene ku di nawa ku nyandera etenda yoiwa, ngeci yodiyo eshima ya Nyambi, kupita ku nyandera etenda yoimango.<verse eid="1PE 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 3:18" />Krisitu naye wa nyanderire evi rofoci karo ro mahurerero, aye o muwawa ku nyandera o dipethso, ci a mi rete kwa Nyambi. Wa paiwire kwirama unone mu Mupepo Nyambi wa mu pire mwoyo karo. <verse eid="1PE 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 3:19" />Ko mupepo wa thzire ku ka honga mipepo ethzi thzi di mu kamenga. <verse eid="1PE 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 3:20" />Ethzo po mipepo thzowa a kanine ku yuvera Nyambi kukare, Nyambi wa tatererire ko ku kwatamucima mo aya mayuwa a umbire Nuwe areka. Anu o mutanu nahatu pohuma awa a yoyithsiwire ko aya meyu o dimina. <verse eid="1PE 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 3:21" />Aya meyu nedi thsimonithso thso korovethzo ethzi thzi mi yoyithsa pano honi, kadi ko ku tundithsa dithziro perama, unone thzo ku romba Nyambi mumoneno oukenu ko kupinduka kwafu kwa Yesu Krisitu, <verse eid="1PE 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 3:22" />aye oyu naa thzi mu wiru no ku kekara ku dyoko dyo rudyo dya Nyambi, ku endithsa tungeru, eyi i di nokoro neyi yoshokoro.<verse eid="1PE 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1PE 4" />
  <para style="rem">AM, MN, TC, CC, Trt</para>
  <para style="s1">Kuyoyera Nyambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 4:1" />Mweyo, pakuninga ci Krisitu wa nyandire mwirama yenthzi, namwe mu citanarithse ko kwikara no muanekerero o kucipitura nou wenthzi, inene yomuhe oyu na a nyanda mwirama na cinuka ku thsivi. <verse eid="1PE 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 4:2" />Mukaci keyo, tumba yoyo mwoyo wo ouhe o pa kaye ku koña ecikumbwethza yoimango yonu, unone aa yoya omu a na shimena Nyambi. <verse eid="1PE 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 4:3" />Inene ku manyima mwa shimbire thsikati thsothsire o ku mu tenda eyi a na tendanga mahedeni, ongurunde, ecikumbwethza yerama, otakwa, mashambirera o mirembe, mashambirera o ku nwa mawarwa, no kurombera ekupuro kokumango nene.<verse eid="1PE 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 4:4" />Mweyo mahedeni aa komoka yoihe mu kana ku cipakererano mu kuhambakana kwo mu ruthziho no mu mwoyo o kaye, mweyo, aa mipithsa mathzina. <verse eid="1PE 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 4:5" />Unone kenge a ku citawera athsinda pa meho a Nyambi, aye oyu na ciroithsera ku ratura ayumi nafu. <verse eid="1PE 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 4:6" />Eyo ngeyi wa hongiwerire Muthzimbu Ouwa noku kwafu, ci shaanga ci a raturiwire mwirama eci edi a di anu wahe, unone ci nga a yoye mu mupepo eci edi a di Nyambi.<verse eid="1PE 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 4:7" />Kupwa kwenu yoihe pepi ku di. Mweyo, mu cihenge no ku kuñwera ci mu twethse ku rombera. <verse eid="1PE 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 4:8" />Nenepo mu twarerere ku cishima oandu ko shemwa, inene thsishimo thsaa thsika evi yoingi. <verse eid="1PE 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 4:9" />Mu tambure amweya mu manthzio enu ko kukana ku tatoka.<verse eid="1PE 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 4:10" />Munu no munu ku kwenu a cikwathsithse thsipa ethsi naa mu pa Nyambi ku kwamena amweya, eci angamba owarurami o thsihemo thsa Nyambi mo ku cithsiathsia. <verse eid="1PE 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 4:11" />Ngeci munu aa amba, a ambe eci oyu amba maywi a Nyambi. Oyu kwamena amweya, a tende kengeyo kokoro ou naa mu pa Nyambi, ci Nyambi a shangariwe mwinu yoihe ka Yesu Krisitu. Kutethzima nokoro ikare yenthzi diyere na diyere! Ameni.<verse eid="1PE 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ku nyandera thsitawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 4:12" />Ashimiwa ange, mwa komoka yoihe i mi keyera iereka yo makando ku na mi ereka, eci thsinu ethsi mu na kana kwiirera. <verse eid="1PE 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 4:13" />Uno honi mu nyanyuke uno mu ciera mu makando a Krisitu, ci nga mwa kwikare no thsinyanyu thsothsikuru mu diyuwa edi kwa ku hokoriwa kutethzima kwenthzi.<verse eid="1PE 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 4:14" />Ngeci mwaa tukathzaniwa mukaci ko dithzina dya Krisitu, mu di no thsiyauthzi, inene Mupepo o kutethzima wa Nyambi pa penu u di. <verse eid="1PE 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 4:15" />Uno honi kwekara shaanga munu yofoci ku kwenu o kunyanda mukaci ko kwipaa munu, kwithza, nji okeremi, nji kwingenangena mwiamba yanu. <verse eid="1PE 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 4:16" />Uno honi, yoihe mu nyanda pa kwikara Makrisitu, mwa fa honyi, unone mu shangare Nyambi pa kwithsiwa ko dithzina dya Krisitu. <verse eid="1PE 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 4:17" />Inene thsikati thsi na kumu thso kuninga ci raturo thza Nyambi thzi tateke, karo kenge thza ku tateka nanua Nyambi. Ngeci o thza ku tateke netu, ngepi ya kwikara kowa na kana ku yuvera Muthzimbu Ouwa? <verse eid="1PE 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 4:18" />Eci edi ku na ñoriwa ci,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 4:18">“Ngeci ikaru owawawa ku yoyithsiwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 4:18">ngepi ya kwikara kowa a na kana ya Nyambi noku kwanu wevi?”<verse eid="1PE 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 4:19" />Mweyo, awa a nyanda mukaci ko ku kwama eshima ya Nyambi, a twarerere ku kwama yoiwa, karo a pake okurupero wo ouhe kwa Mumbi wo o ku rurama.<verse eid="1PE 4:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1PE 5" />
  <para style="rem">AM, MN, TC, CC, Trt</para>
  <para style="s1">Mu dithse mutanga wa Nyambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 5:1" />Honi naa koñomeka akuru o kereke mu kaci kenu, ame ko kwikara mukuru o kereke eci awo, no mbangi o makando a Krisitu, karo naa citapera mu kutethzima oku kwa ku hokoriwa. <verse eid="1PE 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 5:2" />Mu dithse nawa mutanga wa Nyambi ou naa mi pa. Mu u mamere ko kushima kwenu kadi ko ku ooteriwa, kadi ko ku fota ku wanenapo thsimweya, unone ko kushima kwenu ku kwamena Nyambi, eci edi a fota Nyambi. <verse eid="1PE 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 5:3" />Mwa tumina awa na mu piwa ku nyunga, unone mwikare muro ouwa ku mutanga. <verse eid="1PE 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 5:4" />Aye Mudithsani Shokuru ou a ku hokoka, kenge mwa ku tambura mushukwe o kutethzima o kukana kwipa. <verse eid="1PE 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 5:5" />Mofoci, namwe mwa mishumba mu cihuthse kushi thzakuru. Mwaheno mu cihuthse kushi thzo munu no munu o ku mu kwamena pofoci, inene ku na ñoriwa ci,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 5:5">“Nyambi wa ku rwithsa akwamununa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 5:5">unone aa monithsa thsihemo kwakwa ku cihuthsa kushi.”<verse eid="1PE 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 5:6" />Mweyo, mu cihuthse kushi mushi thzo dyoko dya Nyambi dyoshokoro ci a ku mi thzineke ko thsikati ethsi thsi na roera.<verse eid="1PE 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 5:7" />Mu pe ecithzekera yenu yoihe kwa Nyambi, inene aa mi nyunga.<verse eid="1PE 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 5:8" />Mu cihenge no ku kuñwera. Mukwathsithzimbo thsenu, aye shamaonga aa thza o thzinguruka eci nyime oyu vuruma ku fotafota o ku papaura. <verse eid="1PE 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 5:9" />Mu mu kanene, karo mu tanare mu thsitawo thsenu, inene mu na dimuka ci aenthzenu akwakutawa mu kaye kokahe, nawo aa pita mu makando aa mu pita. <verse eid="1PE 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 5:10" />Uno honi, munyima thzo kunyanda kamanana, aye Nyambi o thsihemo thsothsihe, oyu naa mithsera ku kutethzima kwenthzi ko diyere mwa Krisitu, aye thsinda kenge a ku mi huthsera, a ku mi tanarithse, no ku mi pa okoro, karo a ku mi shishe pa mushisho oukoro. <verse eid="1PE 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 5:11" />Okoro wikare wenthzi diyere na diyere. Ameni.<verse eid="1PE 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuvumenena ko mahurerero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 5:12" />Ni na mi ñorera edi diñoro ko wipi ko ku ni kwathsa Silasi, oyu ni pa ombangi ku kwenu ci muenthzetu o ku rurama. Eanekera yange pa ku ñora edi diñoro po ku mi koropithsa no ku mi tanarithsa ci eyi mu pitamo po yashemwa, karo yaekara imweya yo thsihemo thsa Nyambi. Mwimane omu mu thsihemo ko ku tanara.<verse eid="1PE 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 5:13" />Kereke thzo mu Babilona, ethzi naa hangura Nyambi eci amwe, thzaa mi vumenena, mofoci kengeyo no mwanange Mareka. <verse eid="1PE 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 5:14" />Mu civumenene namweya ko ku ciyamwa ko thsishimo. Thsiyaro thsikare nenu mwahe amwe mu di mwa Krisitu.<verse eid="1PE 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 5" />
</usx>